  requirement-listing-response
    defined-by answer
    role localized_response_template
    precondition "a request carries its own text and asks for the requirements that text states"
    effect "lists the requirements the text states, one per line, under a localized intro"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Requirements stated in the text:"
