  opaque-label
    defined-by source-context-opaque-label-contract
    role source-context-opaque-label-contract
    precondition "The loaded source-context grammar completely owns the informational introducer, one Unicode label and terminal punctuation. Paths, quotes, operation cues, attribution, conjunctions and unconsumed prose refuse this classification."
    effect "Only the label is informational context. It grants no operation, source, safety or publication authority, and all following action and immutable Need spans remain independent."
    unit "not applicable"
